### API ka actual processing flow

```javascript

const response = await fetch(
  "https://aiclipping.ssemble.com/api/v1/shorts/create",
  {
    method: "POST",
    headers: {
      "Content-Type": "application/json",
      "X-API-Key": process.env.SSEMBLE_API_KEY
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({
      url: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VIDEO_ID",
      start: 0,
      end: 600,
      preferredLength: "under60sec",
      language: "hi",
      maxShorts: 5,
      layout: "auto",
      captionsEnabled: true
    })
  }
);

const result = await response.json();
console.log(result.data.requestId);
```

Ye official API ke parameters par based illustrative example hai; actual request mein valid key, valid video aur active credits chahiye. Ssemble

Technical detail: API request submit karne ke baad processing asynchronous hoti hai. Request ID milta hai, phir status endpoint poll kar sakte ho ya webhook use kar sakte ho. Processing usually 5–30 minutes ho sakti hai, depending on video length and queue. Ssemble +1

