### Part 6 — Ssemble ke business model aur limitations

Ssemble ke system mein video processing, social publishing aur Developer API alag cost/permission areas hain.

### Credits

Official documentation ke mutabik:

* 1 credit = up to 20 minutes of input video.

* 1-hour video = 3 credits if entire video is processed in 20-minute chunks.

* API create request = 1 credit, regardless of how many clips are generated.

